{# 
  Reusable 3-column service grid for category pages.
  Reduces massive duplication of card + inline SVG boilerplate across handyman.njk, plumbing.njk, property-maintenance.njk, and warehouse.njk.

  Usage in a category page:
    {% set gridItems = [
      { href: "/handyman-services/door-and-window...", key: "door", title: "Door & Window...", desc: "..." },
      ...
    ] %}
